## Weekly data
table lat

## What changed
W35 spiked after the index migration to the new cluster. Latency recovered once query caching shipped in W37, and every percentile has kept falling since, with W41 the best week in the period.

!! W35 is the only week that breached the SLO, with p99 at 688 ms against the 600 ms limit.
